OL,3,GNEWSAImmigration arrests after
OL,4,Aorganised crime blitz
OL,5,
OL,6,FOrganised crime gangs have been hit
OL,7,Fwith a major police offensive in a
OL,8,Fcrackdown on illegal goods, money
OL,9,Flaundering and modern slavery.
OL,11,FIn Devon and Cornwall, police visited
OL,12,F156 cash intensive businesses such as
OL,13,Fbarber shops, hand car washes and
OL,14,Ftake-aways - as part of a nationwide
OL,15,Fprogramme called Operation Machinize.
OL,17,FThe force said 18 people were arrested
OL,18,Ffor a range of suspected crimes
OL,19,Fincluding modern slavery, handling
OL,20,Fstolen goods and aggravated illegal
OL,21,Fentry.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
