OL,3,GNEWSAImmigration arrests after
OL,4,Aorganised crime blitz
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrading standards officers in Devon and
OL,7,FCornwall also seized more than 76,000
OL,8,Fcigarettes and 23kg of hand rolling
OL,9,Ftobacco with a street value of about
OL,10,F#35,000 during the month long operation
OL,11,Fin October.
